# 📝 Django Blog Application

A blog application built using **Python and Django**.  
This project allows users to create, manage, and view blog posts.

---

## 🚀 Technologies Used

- Python
- Django
- SQLite
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Git & GitHub

